<title>CANADA: Seagram Co Q1 Sept 30 net jumps after gain.</title>
<headline>Seagram Co Q1 Sept 30 net jumps after gain.</headline>
<dateline>MONTREAL 1996-10-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996		     1995</p>
<p> Shr			US$0.45		  US$0.18</p>
<p> Net			166,000		   66,000</p>
<p> Revs		   2,944,000		2,971,000</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>Note: First-quarter 1996 net income included a US$39 million after-tax gain on the sale of the DuPont Co warrants.</p>
<p>-- Reuters Toronto Bureau (416) 941-8100</p>
